This repository redistributes two CFIHOS v2.0 inputs published by IOGP JIP36:

- the CORE CFIHOS CSV archive, unpacked under spec/rdl/; and
- the C-DM-002 Data Dictionary workbook under spec/.

The license terms accompanying the CFIHOS data-model download make these
materials available under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0). Preserve IOGP JIP36 attribution when copying or adapting them.
Source: https://www.jip36-cfihos.org/cfihos-standards/

See spec/VERSIONS.md for exact artifact hashes and acquisition dates.

The generated and deployable model is CFIHOS v2.0-aligned. It is not CFIHOS
certified and is not part of the formal conformance program.
